[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE]
Compensation to the Apple Family

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE_desc]
The second agricultural reform seriously damaged the interests of the Apple family, which also led to the tension in our diplomatic relations with Appleloosa. Therefore, we should compensate the Apple family, explain to them that this is an inevitable measure, and try our best to win their understanding.

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE_OPINION_MODIFIER]
Agricultural Reform Compensation

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE]
对苹果家族的补偿

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE_desc]
第二次农业改革严重损害了苹果家族的利益，这也导致我们与苹果鲁萨的外交关系紧张。因此，我们应该对苹果家族进行补偿，向他们说明这是不可避免的举措，并尽力争取他们的谅解。

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_COMPENSATE_OPINION_MODIFIER]
农业改革补偿

